{"route":"/news-highlights/1306-pt-round-02-2024-intimation-letter-and-registration-form","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"PT round-02/2024: Intimation Letter and Registration Form"}],"updated":"2024-07-23","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1306-pt-round-02-2024-intimation-letter-and-registration-form.html","title":"PT round-02/2024: Intimation Letter and Registration Form","bodyHtml":"<p>IPC is going to conduct PT round-02/2024 in <strong>Qualitative test for specific pathogens </strong>in Biological Discipline (Drugs and Pharmaceticals).</p>\n\n<p>You are requested to find the attached <strong>Intimation Letter &amp; <strong>Registraion Form</strong></strong> and send your consent with filled registration form on email at <a href=\"mailto:qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in\">qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in</a> on or before 15th Aug 2024.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Intimation.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">For Intimation Letter click here<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Registration.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">For Registration Form click here<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><br><br></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Intimation_Letter_page-0001.jpg\" alt=\"Image: PT round-02/2024: Intimation Letter and Registration Form\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Intimation_Letter_page-0002.jpg\" alt=\"Image: PT round-02/2024: Intimation Letter and Registration Form\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ><img src=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Registration_Form_page-0001.jpg\" alt=\"Image: PT round-02/2024: Intimation Letter and Registration Form\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" ></p>","date":"2024-07-23","category":"Announcements"}